### 1. Creator login
# @name creatorLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "creator@postflow.com",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### 2. Manager login
# @name managerLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@postflow.com",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### 3. Naya draft banao (201)
# @name p1
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Eid offer",
  "content": "Eid special: buy one get one free.",
  "platforms": ["instagram"]
}

### 4. Manager draft approve nahi kar sakta (404)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 1 d}}"
}

### 5. Creator submit kare (200)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 6. Creator approve nahi kar sakta (403)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 1 d}}"
}

### 7. Approve, waqt ke bina (400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Approve, guzra hua waqt (400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 -1 d}}"
}

### 9. Approve, galat format (400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "tomorrow"
}

### 10. Reject, wajah ke bina (400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": ""
}

### 11. Reject, wajah ke saath (200)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Please add a clearer call to action"
}

### 12. Creator ki notifications (200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 13. Rejected post dobara reject (409)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Second try"
}

### 14. Creator rejected post edit kare (200)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Eid offer (fixed)",
  "content": "Eid special: buy one get one free. Order now at our website!",
  "platforms": ["instagram"]
}

### 15. Dobara submit (200)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 16. Manager approve, kal ka waqt (200)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 1 d}}",
  "comment": "Looks good"
}

### 17. Dobara approve (409)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "{{$datetime iso8601 2 d}}"
}

### 18. Creator post ki detail aur timeline (200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/{{p1.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 19. Creator ki notifications dobara (200)
# @name latest
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 20. Sab se nayi notification "parh li" (200)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/notifications/{{latest.response.body.$.notifications[0].id}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 21. Sab notifications "parh li" (200)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### 22. Notifications bina token ke (401)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notifications

### 23. Manager: scheduled posts ki list (200)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts?status=scheduled
Authorization: Bearer {{managerLogin.response.body.$.token}}